{"3967910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Exit Plan", "steam_appid": 3967910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Exit Plan</i> is a chaotic multiplayer platformer where players don’t just run the level, you build it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with up to 4 players to reach the exit, placing traps, hazards, and ridiculous contraptions along the way. Every round becomes a race through your own bad decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967910/extras/23fe4d617a0ab8f7fcf82f30720c8d8a.poster.avif?t=1777481948\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967910/extras/23fe4d617a0ab8f7fcf82f30720c8d8a.webm?t=1777481948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967910/extras/23fe4d617a0ab8f7fcf82f30720c8d8a.mp4?t=1777481948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Set the stage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each round, players load the level with traps, pitfalls, and ridiculous contraptions designed to stop anyone from reaching the exit. Then, everyone has to run the gauntlet themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967910/extras/bc20236a0a841133401e324f3310e331.poster.avif?t=1777481948\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967910/extras/bc20236a0a841133401e324f3310e331.webm?t=1777481948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967910/extras/bc20236a0a841133401e324f3310e331.mp4?t=1777481948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pick your poison</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your treasure carefully: each one offers powerful buffs… or absurd debuffs that might doom you before you start. Slip, launch, and explode your way through unpredictable maps as laughter and betrayal take center stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967910/extras/1ccb65a0a938e9ae212249e18740dc67.poster.avif?t=1777481948\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967910/extras/1ccb65a0a938e9ae212249e18740dc67.webm?t=1777481948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967910/extras/1ccb65a0a938e9ae212249e18740dc67.mp4?t=1777481948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re sabotaging your friends or falling victim to your own “brilliant” setup, Exit Plan guarantees chaos, creativity, and comedy in every round. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning is optional — <strong>surviving is impressive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967910/extras/d11dfd4461b1288f733e91ce912b208e.poster.avif?t=1777481948\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967910/extras/d11dfd4461b1288f733e91ce912b208e.webm?t=1777481948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967910/extras/d11dfd4461b1288f733e91ce912b208e.mp4?t=1777481948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Exit Plan</i> is a chaotic multiplayer platformer where players don’t just run the level, you build it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with up to 4 players to reach the exit, placing traps, hazards, and ridiculous contraptions along the way. Every round becomes a race through your own bad decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967910/extras/23fe4d617a0ab8f7fcf82f30720c8d8a.poster.avif?t=1777481948\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967910/extras/23fe4d617a0ab8f7fcf82f30720c8d8a.webm?t=1777481948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967910/extras/23fe4d617a0ab8f7fcf82f30720c8d8a.mp4?t=1777481948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Set the stage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each round, players load the level with traps, pitfalls, and ridiculous contraptions designed to stop anyone from reaching the exit. Then, everyone has to run the gauntlet themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967910/extras/bc20236a0a841133401e324f3310e331.poster.avif?t=1777481948\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967910/extras/bc20236a0a841133401e324f3310e331.webm?t=1777481948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967910/extras/bc20236a0a841133401e324f3310e331.mp4?t=1777481948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pick your poison</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your treasure carefully: each one offers powerful buffs… or absurd debuffs that might doom you before you start. Slip, launch, and explode your way through unpredictable maps as laughter and betrayal take center stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967910/extras/1ccb65a0a938e9ae212249e18740dc67.poster.avif?t=1777481948\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967910/extras/1ccb65a0a938e9ae212249e18740dc67.webm?t=1777481948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967910/extras/1ccb65a0a938e9ae212249e18740dc67.mp4?t=1777481948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re sabotaging your friends or falling victim to your own “brilliant” setup, Exit Plan guarantees chaos, creativity, and comedy in every round. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning is optional — <strong>surviving is impressive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967910/extras/d11dfd4461b1288f733e91ce912b208e.poster.avif?t=1777481948\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967910/extras/d11dfd4461b1288f733e91ce912b208e.webm?t=1777481948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967910/extras/d11dfd4461b1288f733e91ce912b208e.mp4?t=1777481948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Build the traps. Dodge the chaos. Beat your friends. Exit Plan flips the platformer formula, players shape and create the dungeon as they race through physics-driven, ever-changing runs.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967910/8cc8fa37d13023aa633b3a1df202cd087d124934/header.jpg?t=1777481948", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967910/1480316ccf8b3bc6158f1a490f1c7365552347bf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777481948", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967910/1480316ccf8b3bc6158f1a490f1c7365552347bf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777481948", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 1400 4 Core or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA 1080 GTX or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Iris Interactive"], "publishers": ["Iris Interactive"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 499, "final": 499, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$4.99"}, "packages": [1393214], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Exit Plan", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1393214, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "Exit Plan - $4.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": f